  2155	# PLAN-177 W0.1 (P1-4) -- the pair-rail DECISION gate
  2156	# ===========================================================================
  2157	# The re-pass of 2026-08-12 found that BOTH release rails read the verdict
  2158	# envelope for pinning, TTL, anchor and delta, and NEITHER read the decision:
  2159	# a cross-model NO-GO returned "OK: verdict ... valid" / exit 0 from the
  2160	# server-side validator, release-gate went green, and only the Owner running
  2161	# OWNER-GA-CUT.sh stood between a negative review and an irreversible publish.
  2162	#
  2163	# CF-3 asymmetry, restated here because it decides what each control PROVES:
  2164	# step 15 carries continue-on-error under CEO_PAIR_RAIL_VERDICT_OPTIONAL=1, so
  2165	# the validator control is a UNIT control over defence in depth; the control
