  2358	# tag guard's regex required the colon immediately after the name, so it
  2359	# counted ONE and parsed GO -- and the local guard is the rail with no escape
  2360	# hatch. The first round of controls could not see this: every fixture line
  2361	# was built as `"verdict: %s"`, which can only produce canonical keys.
