  1728	#
  1729	# PREDICATE CHOICE (the honest part). This is a closed VOCABULARY list with
  1730	# NO negation exemption, and both halves were chosen from evidence, not taste:
  1731	#
  1732	#   * An earlier draft tolerated a phrase when a negation appeared within ~120
  1733	#     chars. Probing the real file showed that exemption firing by ACCIDENT —
