   466	# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   467	# PLAN-106 Wave G.2 — git-checkout retry wrapper around index.lock contention.
   468	# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   469	# Wraps `git checkout --quiet "$PIN_REF"` with a 3-attempt retry on
   470	# `.git/index.lock` busy. Per-attempt audit event via emit_git_index_lock_retry.
   471	# Argv-pass invocation per PLAN-106 §3 Wave G.2.b — never source-string
   472	# interpolation; absolute HOOKS_DIR; PYTHONNOUSERSITE=1 python3 -I.
   473	#
   474	# Override budget via CEO_GIT_LOCK_RETRY_MAX (default 3) for tests.
   475	# Override unit-test override via CEO_GIT_LOCK_RETRY_BACKOFF_BASE (default 1)
